ps://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/30171c4c5fee7ec5834648aa41f83ac9ec6cf704/ss_30171c4c5fee7ec5834648aa41f83ac9ec6cf704.600x338.jpg?t=1764237231"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/0b6ebd6e4247878873960722651299130512baee/ss_0b6ebd6e4247878873960722651299130512baee.1920x1080.jpg?t=1764237231","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3338670/0b6ebd6e4247878873960722651299130512baee/ss_0b6ebd6e4247878873960722651299130512baee.600x338.jpg?t=1764237231"}],"short_description":"The story begins in a mysterious house. Strange items scattered about are key to uncovering the truth. You must ingest them and \u201cvomit blood,\u201d gaining powers at the cost of your health. But beware: the scent of your blood draws a lurking threat that ends the game if it catches you.","steam_appid":3338670,"support_info":{"email":"","url":"https://x.com/SerioustoneClub"},"supported_languages":"Japanese, English","type":"game","website":null}